b.com/users/FoggyFella","html_url":"https://github.com/FoggyFella","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FoggyFella/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FoggyFella/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FoggyFella/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FoggyFella/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FoggyFella/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FoggyFella/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FoggyFella/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FoggyFella/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FoggyFella/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-01T19:29:03Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T19:33:59Z","body":"Added support for `Glyphs(Right-To-Left)` and a helpful `_is_glyph_visible` function.  I am not sure what the difference between  `Glyphs(Right-To-Left)` and `Characters After Shaping` is so they behave the same. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e43f295a-4462-4112-ba01-ee1c8865075b\r\n\r\nI am also unsure what to do about  `Glyphs(Layout Direction)` as that is dependent on the node being a `Control`, which the `Label3D` is not.  I am unaware if there is a way to somehow omit one of the enum values so I have thought about making a new enum in the `text_server.h` that just omits  `Glyphs(Layout Direction)`.  @bruvzg what would you say is the right thing to do?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3145563583/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3145579162","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109081#issuecomment-3145579162","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109081","id":3145579162,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67fbqa","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-01T19:35:52Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T19:35:52Z","body":"> I am also unsure what to do about Glyphs(Layout Direction) as that is dependent on the node being a Control\r\n\r\nThere's no layout direction for Label3D, but it can use `text_direction` instead. Or you can skip it by setting enum values:\r\n```c++\r\nADD_PROPERTY(PropertyInfo(Variant::INT, \"visible_characters_behavior\", PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM, \"Characters Before Shaping:0,Characters After Shaping:1,Glyphs (Left-to-Right):3,Glyphs (Right-to-Left):4\"), \"set_visible_characters_behavior\", \"get_visible_characters_behavior\");\r\n```\r\nand a check in the `set_visible_characters_behavior` to print error if it's used.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3145579162/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":n